    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50580" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vernīlĭtas</span></b> ,
			ātis, f.
		vernilis (mostly post-Aug.). <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Cringing obsequiousness</i>, <i>servility</i>, <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep. 95,
			2</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Coarse</i>, <i>pert</i>, <i>jesting</i>, <i>pertness</i>, Plaut.
			Fragm. ap. <i><span class="en">Non. 342, 17</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Quint. 1,
				11, 2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 34, 8, 19, §
		79</span></i>.</div>
